<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:38:18 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Flutter Flame 教程：从零打造你的第一款 2D 游戏（新手指南）</title><link>https://dev.to/techstackgame/flutter-flame-tutorial-build-your-first-2d-game-beginner-guide-2jmk</link><description>已会 Flutter 的开发者离做出第一款游戏其实很近，这篇新手教程带你用 Flame 引擎上手 2D 游戏开发。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:54:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">70d1325a53202a923b507ada1a94f7d58d1f904d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/techstackgame/flutter-flame-tutorial-build-your-first-2d-game-beginner-guide-2jmk">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>这款工具把 2D 绘画工作流带进 Unreal Engine 5</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5</link><description>Inky 工具在 UE5 里复现传统绘画材料的笔触质感，让美术可以直接用 2D 绘画方式做 3D 材质。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">06f563d4015b1e4207822d97add89bedf8236479</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/this-tool-brings-2d-painting-workflows-into-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower 推出网店收入预估工具</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/sensor-tower-introduces-web-store-revenue-estimates</link><description>Sensor Tower 新增直销网店收入预估，开发者现在能同时看到应用商店与自家网店的变现全貌。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b2b3a941eac58cadaae11d61a239d763a7c7e3fe</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/sensor-tower-introduces-web-store-revenue-estimates">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>2026 年 10 月手游榜单：Top Lords 异军突起，腾讯下滑 11%，AI 开始监听</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/october-2026-mobile-game-charts-top-lords-takes-off-tencent-falls-11-and-ai-listens-in</link><description>AppMagic 数据显示 10 月手游下载与收入榜出现新面孔 Top Lords，腾讯