5:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ddf04b4d07b05bb91877c5ae0f53b125ad4fba5e</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607139">GameLook</source></item><item><title>索尼狂喜！40% PS5 玩家涌入 GTA6，3900 万人进城，七成新机首玩即是它</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607166</link><description>索尼披露《GTA6》发售初期的平台数据：四成 PS5 玩家涌入，3900 万人进城，七成新机首玩就是它。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:59:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1f196c5007b967c9b7e8bb469aa90bc32d1a06d1</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607166">GameLook</source></item><item><title>全员同一道每日谜题、不用服务器：用 React Native 做 7 个离线谜题的笔记</title><link>https://dev.to/thankvn/same-daily-puzzle-for-everyone-no-server-notes-from-building-7-offline-puzzles-in-react-native-lcp</link><description>独立开发者 Thanh 分享如何不用服务器、让全球玩家每天玩到同一道谜题，7 个离线谜题已进他的 AhaBox 应用。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:50:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f9a725272db84cc28919b945e9437d71498d795e</guid><source url="https://dev.to/thankvn/same-daily-puzzle-for-everyone-no-server-notes-from-building-7-offline-puzzles-in-react-native-lcp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>把游戏发到日本：文本换行、占位符、代词与该留在英文里的东西</title><link>https://dev.to/gtelocalize/shipping-a-game-in-japanese-text-wrapping-placeholders-pronouns-and-what-to-leave-in-english-2alm</link><description>日本市场付费意愿高但本地化门槛也高，这篇实战总结讲游戏日文本地化最容易翻车的几处：换行、占位符、代词，以及哪些词就该留在英文。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:11:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a7e6705ff6acab0db1a103f98ffa220b597f2f97</guid><source url="https://dev.to/gtelocalize/shipping-a-game-in-japanese-text-wrapping-placeholders-pronouns-and-what-to-leave-in-english-2alm">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>12 天狂销百万套！《我带过最差的一届》成为今年第四款百万级国产单机</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607201</link><description>顽核社的《我带过最差的一届》发售仅 12 天销量突破百万套，成为今年第四款达成这一成绩的国产单机游戏，小团队的题材选择与发行节奏值得独立开发者借鉴。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:44:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">543589e7ceba04354a280ffaba85a223a190dc91</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607201">GameLook</source></item><item><title>用三阶段 Python 干跑—灰度—应用管线与 3D 样条净空审计，杜绝 Unreal Engine 5 世界分区灾难</title><link>https://dev.to/juan_manuelrevillamaill/preventing-world-partition-disasters-in-unreal-engine-5-with-a-3-stage-python-dry-canary-apply-2gd4</link><description>作者在大型高山铁路地图上踩过批量改动的坑后，总结出一套先干跑、再灰度、最后应用的三阶段安全变异管线，配合可逆 JSON 备份与样条净空审计，让 UE5 世界分区的大规模编辑不再一失手就毁掉上千个 Actor。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:59:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d5eec6440f76a9c762674ee3bf3e25723034ed7d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juan_manuelrevillamaill/preventing-world-partition-disasters-in-unreal-engine-5-with-a-3-stage-python-dry-canary-apply-2gd4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>索尼无光盘未来几成定局：今年仅七款游戏实体销量破十万</title><link>https://dev.to/mango7777/sonys-disc-less-future-looks-inevitable-when-only-seven-games-hit-100k-physical-sales-all</link><description>Circana 数据显示今年全美仅七款 PlayStation 游戏实体销量超过十万份，实体渠道的萎缩速度比许多人预想的更快，独立开发者做实体发行决策时值得参考。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a44ffd8cc8f4a187ff8b7cf3698758ebcecacfa3</guid><source url="https://dev.to/mango7777/sonys-disc-less-future-looks-inevitable-when-only-seven-games-hit-100k-physical-sales-all">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unity 中端手机性能优化八点复盘</title><link>https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298719-a-unity-performance-pass-for-mid-range-phones-an-eight-point-review</link><description>针对中端机型的 Unity 性能优化清单，八个检查点帮手游在老设备上稳住帧率与留存。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:48:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b3bc07e849e66b87cb64e7e5e6808452056de025</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298719-a-unity-performance-pass-for-mid-range-phones-an-eight-point-review">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>为什么日文只在打包后的 UE5 版本里变成方块字</title><link>https://dev.to/sasakidevtools/why-japanese-text-turns-into-tofu-boxes-only-in-packaged-unreal-engine-5-builds-91c</lin